; The local `entry` (keys: :binding) shadows the global `entry` (keys: :at).
; Validating against the local: :at is unknown_key and :binding is missing — a
; global entry would have accepted :at cleanly, so this proves the shadow.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code unknown_key :path [bind-group entry at])
  (diagnostic :code missing_required_key :path [bind-group entry]))
